   <conbody><p>This section describes the information and specifications related to the temperature sensors on the SMS.</p>
<p>Most motor faults will eventually result in high temperatures. These high temperatures can be an indication of the excessive friction within a motor or of OtoSense™ SMS is equipped with two on-board temperature sensors: an environment temperature sensor and a motor temperature sensor. For specifications, ￼Table ￼.</p>
<p>The environment temperature sensor allows for ADI OtoSense™ SMS to take ambient operating conditions, such as sunlight exposure, into account when assessing a motor’s temperature status.</p>
